  "body": "Follow-up of PR #3350 (second read, comment 7080865221). The PR tests the planned path and the refusals for a picked start with compensation in the control or wear compensation. No test checks the posted program.\n\nNecessary work: one test that posts a closed outside contour with a picked start, climb, control compensation, and asserts the lines around the lead-in and the lead-out: `G41` (or `G42`) is on the straight lead-in block, `G40` is on the straight lead-out block, and no compensation word is on an arc block. The same for wear compensation. Use a recorded `.cl` file in the post crate.\n\nRefs #1473\n",
